/**
 * @dir lib
 * @brief Root of the library: the umbrella header leases.hpp and the folder leases/.
 *
 * @dir lib/leases
 * @brief All the modules, in namespace fcpp::coordination::leases (see the page @ref architecture).
 *
 * @dir lib/leases/common
 * @brief Basic types, wrap-around-safe counters and compact durations in messages.
 *
 * @dir lib/leases/model
 * @brief Data only: the actual fault, the events, the checkpoint, the lease, the decisions of the resources, the tasks.
 *
 * @dir lib/leases/ownership
 * @brief Who may act on a job: the rules of the echo-confirmed lease.
 *
 * @dir lib/leases/sim
 * @brief Fault plan, for simulation and tests only.
 */

